    "body": "When many vLLM workers load a new LoRA adapter simultaneously and the remote adapter_config.json is temporarily unavailable (e.g. HF Hub cache miss, NFS lag), deterministic exponential backoff causes all workers to retry in lockstep — amplifying load on upstream storage.\n\nThis adds full jitter `[0, backoff)` to each retry, bounded by the remaining time before a 1-second hard deadline, and extracts the retry loop into `PEFTHelper._load_adapter_config()`.\n\nCloses #44245\n\n**Checklist**\n- [x] Tests added for retry-on-JSONDecodeError and retry-on-FileNotFoundError\n- [x] All existing LoRA tests unchanged",
    "changed_files": 2,
